Governance_notes:
On Plan: Plan for achieving target (https://www.telstra.com.au/climate/how-telstra-continues-to-reduce-its-impact-on-climate-change); And the Company explains its 'Approach' and climate action initiatives in details in its sustainability report (See 2024 Sustainability Report, P.36 onwards.) 

On Reporting: Telstra have engaged Ernst & Young (EY) to provide limited assurance over a selection of their performance disclosures. (P.10, 2024 Sustainability Report);

On Leadership Accountability: Executive pay officially linked to emission reduction targets: "Remuneration for our executives and most of our employees includes a variable component linked to performance against a range of companywide targets and personal objectives. In FY24, the selected company objectives included our absolute scope 1+2 and scope 3 emissions reduction targets." (P.48, 2024 Annual Report: https://web.archive.org/web/20250728152823/https://www.telstra.com.au/content/dam/tcom/about-us/investors/pdf-g/telstra-annual-report-2024.pdf)

